.TH "ARC-BACKENDS" "1" "2026-09-27" "arc-cli" "Arc Manual"
.SH "NAME"
arc\-backends \- inspect native backend capabilities
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
arc backends [OPTIONS]
.PP
arcbe ...
.PP
arc\-backends ...
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Report configured backend preference order, installed binaries, and normalized capabilities rather than assuming similarly named native tools are interchangeable.
.SH "OPTIONS"
\-\-json
.PP
\-\-remote NAME
.SH "EXAMPLES"
arc backends
.PP
arc backends \-\-remote tablet
.SH "SEE ALSO"
arc\-backends(7), arc\-formats(7)
